{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"GEN","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"創世記","commonName":"創世記","title":"創世記","order":1,"numberOfChapters":50,"sha256":"c386c509bcaf2d2e415b454ca78f5cfd89495b0f945d3896fb5dab5baca206b4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/GEN/1.json","lastChapterNumber":50,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/GEN/50.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1532},"chapter":{"number":5,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["亞當的後代"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["亞當的後代記在下面。（當上帝造人的日子，是照着自己的樣式造的，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["並且造男造女。在他們被造的日子，上帝賜福給他們，稱他們為「人」。）"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["亞當活到一百三十歲，生了一個兒子，形像樣式和自己相似，就給他起名叫塞特。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["亞當生塞特之後，又在世八百年，並且生兒養女。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["亞當共活了九百三十歲就死了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["塞特活到一百零五歲，生了以挪士。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["塞特生以挪士之後，又活了八百零七年，並且生兒養女。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["塞特共活了九百一十二歲就死了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["以挪士活到九十歲，生了該南。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["以挪士生該南之後，又活了八百一十五年，並且生兒養女。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["以挪士共活了九百零五歲就死了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["該南活到七十歲，生了瑪勒列。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["該南生瑪勒列之後，又活了八百四十年，並且生兒養女。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["該南共活了九百一十歲就死了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["瑪勒列活到六十五歲，生了雅列。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["瑪勒列生雅列之後，又活了八百三十年，並且生兒養女。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["瑪勒列共活了八百九十五歲就死了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["雅列活到一百六十二歲，生了以諾。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["雅列生以諾之後，又活了八百年，並且生兒養女。"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["雅列共活了九百六十二歲就死了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["以諾活到六十五歲，生了瑪土撒拉。"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["以諾生瑪土撒拉之後，與上帝同行三百年，並且生兒養女。"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["以諾共活了三百六十五歲。"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["以諾與上帝同行，上帝將他取去，他就不在世了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["瑪土撒拉活到一百八十七歲，生了拉麥。"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["瑪土撒拉生拉麥之後，又活了七百八十二年，並且生兒養女。"]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":["瑪土撒拉共活了九百六十九歲就死了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":["拉麥活到一百八十二歲，生了一個兒子，"]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":["給他起名叫挪亞，說：「這個兒子必為我們的操作和手中的勞苦安慰我們；這操作勞苦是因為耶和華咒詛地。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":["拉麥生挪亞之後，又活了五百九十五年，並且生兒養女。"]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":["拉麥共活了七百七十七歲就死了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":32,"content":["挪亞五百歲生了閃、含、雅弗。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/GEN/5.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/GEN/6.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/GEN/4.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":32}